=== width 0
[bold,italic,double-underline]frobnicate[]

A
small
command
line
tool
that
[bold]frobnicates[]
files,
[italic]quickly[]
and
with
[yellow]zero[]
configuration.
See
[underline]https://example.com/frobnicate[]
for
the
full
manual,
or
ask
in
the
chat.

[bold,underline]Installation[]

Install
from
source
with
a
recent
Rust
toolchain:

  cargo install frobnicate
  frobnicate[cyan] --version[]

Prebuilt
binaries
are
available
for
these
platforms:

• Linux,
  x86_64
  and
  aarch64
• macOS,
  Apple
  silicon
  and
  Intel
• Windows,
  x86_64
  only
  • requires
    the
    Visual
    C++
    runtime
  • no
    ARM
    build
    yet

[bold,underline]Usage[]

  [yellow]frobnicate [OPTIONS] <FILE>...[]

